A young musician in deep meditative focus, eyes closed, fingers poised on an electric guitar, bathed in dramatic purple and neon pink stage lighting. The scene is rendered in bold cyberpunk style with holographic sound waves rippling outward from the guitar strings, digital grid patterns floating in the smoky background, and chrome reflections gleaming off the instrument. The figure wears a sleek futuristic jacket with glowing circuit-like trim. The atmosphere captures pure zen-like concentration amid sensory overload—stillness within chaos—as geometric light beams slice through the hazy air of a dystopian concert venue.
